[{"title":"咏史 其二 霍光","author":"陈普","text":"几度咸阳累积尸，尽缘丘冢似焉支。\n覆车愁杀张车骑，印绶临身必十辞。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7234,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 魏相","author":"陈普","text":"贾生晁错总佻轻，博陆营平亦好兵。\n地节三年谁作相，胡天汉地各春生。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7235,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其三 魏相","author":"陈普","text":"赵禹张汤网未收，外人董偃化方流。\n丞相但看汉故事，何但宣皇不用周。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7236,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 夔垂","author":"陈普","text":"卿云华月丽衣裳，抟拊初登下凤凰。\n竹矢区区天亦爱，河图相伴到成康。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7237,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 卫瓘","author":"陈普","text":"此座倾危不信人，此身便合去朝廷。\n凌云莫道非真醉，直到身亡更未醒。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7238,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其二 卫瓘","author":"陈普","text":"拓拔枝柯幸少疏，洛阳宫殿已为墟。\n休论荣晦师田续，忍读金墉稽颡书。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7239,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 中山王衮","author":"陈普","text":"老卒无多尽守藩，更无毫发罪堪言。\n东堂断手平生足，玉井蟾蜍任吐吞。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7240,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 山涛","author":"陈普","text":"君王祖述竹林风，竹叶纷纷插满宫。\n祸乱古今惟晋酷，是非忧乐一山公。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7241,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其三 五王","author":"陈普","text":"唐室存亡有化机，亳州刺史独依依。\n阳乌本是蟾蜍魄，空唤群龙为夹飞。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7242,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其二 五王","author":"陈普","text":"太宗社稷是谁亡，独向迎仙斩二张。\n景运门前方议事，杀身不必咎扶阳。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7243,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 五王","author":"陈普","text":"宫中双陆可长吁，取日忠臣若釜鱼。\n莫道断蛇无决裂，天戈失却老蟾蜍。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7244,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 元紫芝","author":"陈普","text":"天宝膏肓在羽衣，寂寥于蔿讵能医。\n当时宇宙皆声色，不梦阳台一紫芝。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7245,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 毌丘俭","author":"陈普","text":"十万强兵无一人，义师翻得叛臣名。\n奇功一夜归人手，空使文鸯待到明。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7246,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 王导","author":"陈普","text":"不听君王到寿春，肯容曲允起咸秦。\n茂弘周顗浑无晋，何但琅琊不是亲。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7247,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其三 王导","author":"陈普","text":"万里凉州道李雄，几重辽海到江东。\n天台更弃金陵去，端有何颜见北风。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7248,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其四 王导","author":"陈普","text":"漠漠胡尘扑面飞，对人举扇障元规。\n九京羞见青衣帝，犹及刘翔未到时。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7249,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其二 王导","author":"陈普","text":"醉中送首悲刘胤，食里迷唇吊马流。\n江左当年何所恃，邺中白雁合封侯。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7250,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 王荆公","author":"陈普","text":"鸳鸿阵阵落南溟，长乐钟中黑眚行。\n逐客不愁人鲊瓮，荷花落日第含情。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7251,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 王祥","author":"陈普","text":"君王宫里望安舒，何啻慈亲念鲤鱼。\n体认卧冰真意思，忍看成济犯銮舆。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7252,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其二 王祥","author":"陈普","text":"倒载山公即巨源，清谈安石幼舆孙。\n晋家祸乱深如海，半出咸熙太尉门。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7253,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其二 王猛","author":"陈普","text":"一奋冲天跨六州，生前天已怒旄头。\n开何有意容王猛，肯使鱼羊食不留。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7254,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 王猛","author":"陈普","text":"鱼水欢浓更月氐，便呵氐族使耕炊。\n浮云蔽日何难见，独有操琴赵整知。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7255,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 王裒","author":"陈普","text":"正始颓波万丈深，卧冰泣竹尽漂沉。\n尚馀泪染无枝树，撑拄乾坤直到今。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7256,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 王羲之","author":"陈普","text":"不缘廊庙尽谈空，安得狐狸啸晋宫。\n王氏可人惟逸少，更容谢万作三公。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7257,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 邓艾","author":"陈普","text":"刘葛元非百世雠，缘崖攀木作猿猴。\n瞻崇艾会谁芳臭，死国沉身各二头。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7258,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其二 邓艾","author":"陈普","text":"灭吴不解诛宰嚭，拜假何须便不咨。\n受任两无曹与马，槛车破了欲何之。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7259,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 北地王谌","author":"陈普","text":"何物谯周口似簧，几年汉帝手牵羊。\n纷纷蜀土祠诸葛，香火曾分北地王。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7260,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 卢怀慎","author":"陈普","text":"菜耳杯盘冷似水，开元天下煖如春。\n唐人不识调羹手，把作姚崇伴食人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7261,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 卢奕","author":"陈普","text":"清门死节照当时，面血犹能赤义旗。\n常山睢阳信奇伟，英风生自洛留司。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7262,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 司马孚","author":"陈普","text":"心地终输范粲安，鱼熊兼得古今难。\n永嘉陵墓温明器，得似安平素木棺。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7263,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其二 司马宣王","author":"陈普","text":"燕鹊寒巢不暂宁，百年盗贼不曾停。\n豺狼首领皆回顾，曾见青衣立汉庭。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7264,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其五 司马宣王","author":"陈普","text":"家门营立事方新，已畜倾巢覆穴人。\n出尔到头终反尔，寡孤何用必随身。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7265,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 司马宣王","author":"陈普","text":"诸葛诞谋非是诞，令狐愚计未为愚。\n豺狼颈项何堪抱，千载犹悲误托孤。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7266,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其三 司马宣王","author":"陈普","text":"蒋琬费祎亦如虎，孙权天险据江湖。\n曹年石马来何暮，也畏平沙八阵图。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7267,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其四 司马宣王","author":"陈普","text":"伦杀淮南炎杀攸，天将造化马为牛。\n古来逆种并奸息，不问贤愚统是愁。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7268,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 司马温公","author":"陈普","text":"矩步规行范古今，山樵野牧共讴吟。\n荷衣兰佩通身是，却看离骚不入心。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7269,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其三 司马温公","author":"陈普","text":"步趋坐立若山河，盛德华夷共咏歌。\n议论偏颇真可怪，阿瞒高帝彧萧何。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7270,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其二 司马温公","author":"陈普","text":"千载争刳汉贼肠，及观通鉴似文王。\n两间正气都输予，犹惜坤中一点黄。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7271,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其四 关羽","author":"陈普","text":"羽血未乾蒙陨命，蒙妻正哭妾分香。\n天地有心诛汉贼，但迟数月取襄阳。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7272,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其三 关羽","author":"陈普","text":"北人更欲生关羽，犹倚糜芳信士仁。\n曹操雄心怀白马，董昭空自弄精神。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7273,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其二 关羽","author":"陈普","text":"寝席羹杯几载同，不知玄德访隆中。\n吕蒙陆逊诚奸贼，消为孙登作妇翁。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7274,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 关羽","author":"陈普","text":"巴山汉水本兴刘，诸葛才华备酂留。\n但得关髯师广武，北州韩信在南州。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7275,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 刘弘","author":"陈普","text":"三纲政自诛辛冉，二盗清由识士行。\n江左百年半天下，曾知开辟是新城。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7276,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 刘琨","author":"陈普","text":"竹林遗类入荆杨，贾郭馀尘在晋阳。\n听得平阳消息否，忍听徐润调笙簧。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7277,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其三 刘裕","author":"陈普","text":"长安何但遗黎舞，翁仲铜驼亦笑开。\n他日佛狸南下路，青泥千尺髑髅台。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7278,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 刘裕","author":"陈普","text":"云雨蛟龙无世无，睡中往往失明珠。\n比干七窍天何惜，不付曹瞒与寄奴。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7279,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其二 刘裕","author":"陈普","text":"何事佛狸能度淮，中原千尺髑髅台。\n无巢燕子宁依树，不入乌衣巷里来。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7280,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其四 刘裕","author":"陈普","text":"杀人广固哭如雷，肯任长安住不回。\n想是齐秦人共语，不知胡羯自南来。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7281,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 刘道规","author":"陈普","text":"荆州一席不肯取，晋鼎百年宁忍移。\n不死卢循函首日，忍看张伟授罂时。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7282,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 吕蒙","author":"陈普","text":"刘葛无成痛古今，白衣摇橹阱何深。\n吕蒙公瑾俱无禄，汉室犹关造化心。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7283,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 孙权","author":"陈普","text":"不信张昭未是奇，贼来送死又何疑。\n一生谄事欺孤操，操死犹臣不十丕。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7284,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 朱文公","author":"陈普","text":"九野寒威闭六阴，一川风月伴瑶琴。\n鼓楼岩下人如玉，说与渔郎仔细寻。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7285,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 江统","author":"陈普","text":"卞庄已睨斗于菟，荛论方规逐五胡。\n莫把乱华罪夷狄，鲜卑臣节过猗卢。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7286,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其二 羊祜","author":"陈普","text":"尺鲤何曾到贾充，太阿曾拟血王戎。\n泪痕不到沉碑上，似为苞苴走路中。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7287,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 羊祜","author":"陈普","text":"群心争欲剸公闾，愁杀凌云醉老奴。\n缓带轻裘信潇洒，曾知晋事已如吴。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7288,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其三 羊祜","author":"陈普","text":"吕蒙江上橹犹羞，曹操徐州血尚留。\n千古渭滨并岘首，泪痕不逐谷陵收。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7289,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 阮籍","author":"陈普","text":"中道难行古已然，东边扶起又西边。\n一般等是墟人国，莫道三君与七贤。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7290,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其二 阮籍","author":"陈普","text":"截发哀号孽妇前，晋家无地亦无天。\n当时阮籍丘中骨，掷向黄河尚带膻。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7291,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 何无忌","author":"陈普","text":"怀恩马柳志何卑，挟恨东堂德愈衰。\n犹有豫章苏武节，不惭京口协谋时。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7292,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 何晏","author":"陈普","text":"罗襦帝子本同生，故把玄谈乱浊清。\n粉面青蝇麾不去，到头白黑自分明。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7293,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其二 何曾","author":"陈普","text":"家国儿曹付五胡，奉身恨不及齐奴。\n君王但说平生事，政为诸公昧远图。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7294,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其四 张华","author":"陈普","text":"满耳羊车若不知，聋人何怪履危机。\n中台星拆浑閒事，哭杀旄头彗紫微。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7295,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其二 张华","author":"陈普","text":"应是诸公爱阮咸，所天亦把付清谈。\n张林若责金墉后，当日张华死更甘。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7296,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 张华","author":"陈普","text":"孙皓泥头入洛阳，后庭夺目万红妆。\n铜驼北去还西徙，不怨荀冯怨杜张。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7297,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其三 张华","author":"陈普","text":"孟观孙秀尚同寅，足了优游卒岁身。\n牛斗豫章才尺五，中台何事不关人。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7298,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 张翰","author":"陈普","text":"晋家事势若崩河，忘却吴松好月波。\n莫把李膺誇二陆，思鲈羡鹤不曾多。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7299,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 杜预","author":"陈普","text":"晋武良心独未亡，娼家渎礼自多妨。\n洛中冠盖无多日，元凯春秋亦短长。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7300,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其二 杜预","author":"陈普","text":"旄头两度茀钩陈，黄色频年斗孟春。\n长历春秋两高阁，东南填淤正肥民。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7301,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 杨太后","author":"陈普","text":"丑短妍长熟用心，国家持换郭槐金。\n一门姊妹同倾晋，饿死犹轻罪更深。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7302,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 杨修","author":"陈普","text":"簏中是绢不能知，妄把聪明察色丝。\n五等人伦皆扫地，多文好学欲何为。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7303,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 杨珧","author":"陈普","text":"涂山千载又关雎，几世天家共玉舆。\n不友凤凰池上客，全宗安用石函书。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7304,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 苏东坡","author":"陈普","text":"方朔优旃岂舜徒，南来谩喜落苍梧。\n天津醉里乾坤眼，只见双程不见苏。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7305,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其一 陆机","author":"陈普","text":"千里莼羹七里尸，两般滋味岂难知。\n建春不幸成繻葛，割尽流苏定此时。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7306,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 其二 陆机","author":"陈普","text":"须信雕虫不用工，至今天地不相容。\n君看奕叶东吴陆，转作词章便覆宗。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7307,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}},{"title":"咏史 周处","author":"陈普","text":"白额长蛇已就戡，不知贾郭更难堪。\n东吴陆喜乡先辈，五等还应有第三。","collection":"宋末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋末元初.csv","pointer":7308,"sha256":"472d136ba142938f73d71ca3d2fd7a0fa6b2908290001e25e5a7e4a562b239b8","dynasty":"宋末元初"}}]